# Llama Manager Flasher — line-ending normalization.
#
# This repository is built on linux, mac, AND windows CI nodes from the same
# commit, so a file's bytes must not depend on which platform checked it out.
# Without this, git hands a Windows node CRLF and any test that compares file
# CONTENT against a literal fails there and only there — tests/theme.test.ts
# matches multi-line CSS selector lists, and its windows job failed with
# "no rule for selector: body:has(.card-amd:hover),..." while linux and mac
# passed.
#
# eol=lf checks every text file out with LF everywhere. Nothing here needs CRLF
# (the repo ships no .bat/.cmd/.ps1), and binary assets are excluded so they are
# never munged.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dmg binary
*.AppImage binary
